[node name="DoggerlandCrowdBlock" type="Node3D" parent="StreamContainer" unique_id=900000000]
editor_description = "H3 (docs/scope_horizon.md) crowd-readability test population — 18 hand-placed NPCBase instances across all five visible archetypes (npc/npc_archetype_data.gd, docs/npc_archetypes.md), replacing the three stacked NPCTestInstance placeholders that used to sit here. Density follows npc_archetypes.md §5's Doggerland composition (Vagrant/Thug dominant, Clerk rare); Commuter/Patrolman counts are this scene's own call, since §5 doesn't list either for Doggerland. Plain scene nodes, no spawner script — not part of StreamingSystems and not generated by any placer, so this group survives streaming and world-content rebuilds like the placeholders it replaces did. Remove (or grow into real placement) once a spawn system exists."

